{"unit_id":"tinqiao-oss__engramory#card-zh","repo":"tinqiao-oss/engramory","commit":"e84b50924b7017259737d57309fc55839225ffc0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-engramory 是 DeepSeek Harness（DSH）的长期记忆插件。它把记忆保存为可直接查看和编辑的 Markdown 文件，并在会话步骤中自动带入记忆索引，让模型按需打开具体笔记。插件提供内置记忆规则、索引增长上限与写入前判断、临近上下文压缩时的记忆提醒，以及用于查看笔记、检查索引和管理设置的侧栏页面；还支持陪伴与社交模式及迁移全局存储。适合希望在 DSH 中跨会话保留精选记忆、同时自行管理本地文件的用户。无需 API key；需在 DSH 中安装插件。","source":"generated","evidence":["adapters/dsh/plugin/index.js:222-234","adapters/dsh/plugin/index.js:391-416","adapters/dsh/plugin/index.js:509-548"]}
{"unit_id":"tinqiao-oss__engramory#card-en","repo":"tinqiao-oss/engramory","commit":"e84b50924b7017259737d57309fc55839225ffc0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-engramory gives DSH long-term memory in editable Markdown files. It injects a memory index, caps supported writes, registers memory instructions, and can prompt before context compaction. Its sidebar lists notes and index health. Companion and social modes are included; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["adapters/dsh/plugin/index.js:222-234","adapters/dsh/plugin/index.js:391-416","adapters/dsh/plugin/index.js:509-548"]}
