{"unit_id":"tinqiao-oss__engramory#caveat-1","repo":"tinqiao-oss/engramory","commit":"e84b50924b7017259737d57309fc55839225ffc0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-engramory 使用前须知：索引自动注入会将记忆索引内容加入模型上下文；按笔记回忆出的信息也会随 DSH 请求发送给所配置的模型服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["adapters/dsh/plugin/index.js:391-405"]}
{"unit_id":"tinqiao-oss__engramory#caveat-2","repo":"tinqiao-oss/engramory","commit":"e84b50924b7017259737d57309fc55839225ffc0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-engramory 使用前须知：插件的写入上限只处理可识别的 DSH 文件工具操作；源码说明未知工具会放行，因此其他写入途径不受该判断覆盖。","source":"generated","evidence":["adapters/dsh/plugin/index.js:216-234"]}
